---
// Why Octavise section
---

<section class="section container why-section" id="dashboard">
  <div class="why-kicker">Why Octavise?</div>
  <div class="why-headline">
    <h2>Grow your practice, not your reporting workload</h2>
    <p>
      Smaller health practices can burn thousands of dollars a month before
      the reports make sense. Octavise connects ad activity to real practice
      outcomes, so owners can focus on growth instead of reconciling spreadsheets.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="why-card-grid">
    <article class="why-card">
      <div class="why-visual soft-photo">
        <div class="icon-cluster" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>↗</span>
          <span>$</span>
          <span>◷</span>
          <span>＋</span>
          <span>◎</span>
          <span>⌁</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>One product for practice growth signals</h3>
      <p>
        Ad spend, bookings, new patients, revenue, referrals, and practice
        movement in one operating view.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="why-card">
      <div class="why-visual chat-visual">
        <div class="chat-window">
          <div class="chat-title"># ad-impact</div>
          <div class="chat-row">
            <span class="avatar"></span>
            <p><strong>Octavise</strong> Google Search drove fewer leads, but higher first-month revenue.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-row muted-row">
            <span class="avatar blue"></span>
            <p><strong>Owner</strong> Increase search before scaling Meta tests.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>Works where decisions already happen</h3>
      <p>
        Turn performance reports into plain-English next steps for owners,
        managers, and marketing partners.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="why-card">
      <div class="why-visual outcome-visual">
        <div class="outcome-panel">
          <div class="outcome-row">
            <span>Meta Ads</span>
            <strong>17 patients</strong>
            <em>$9.8k revenue</em>
          </div>
          <div class="outcome-row">
            <span>Google Ads</span>
            <strong>24 patients</strong>
            <em>$18.4k revenue</em>
          </div>
          <div class="outcome-row">
            <span>Referrals</span>
            <strong>31 patients</strong>
            <em>$22.1k revenue</em>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>Patient outcomes, no guesswork</h3>
      <p>
        Compare channels by the patients and revenue they create, not only
        the conversions an ad platform reports.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
